false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-09T09:39:31Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T12:36:22Z","closed_at":"2025-10-07T12:36:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5-rc1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.rc1 - Fedora Linux 42 (Workstation Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon Graphics (radeonsi, renoir, ACO, DRM 3.63, 6.15.10-200.fc42.x86_64) - AMD Ryzen 9 4900HS with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 38.58 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot does not import normal maps specified in `.mtl` files like this:\n\n```\nmap_Bump -bm 1.000000 Textures/T_Plaster_Normal.png\n```\n\nApparently such an MTL file was created by Blender 4.0.2 (it comes from a Quaternius asset pack), so I think this format should be supported.\n\nWe can see in the source code why it does not work:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2dd26a027a99633231184616d4dd287bbdd1c0a3/editor/import/3d/resource_importer_obj.cpp#L177-L184\n\nFirstly it does not consider `map_Bump` (which may be nonstandard, but evidently is used).\n\nSecondly, it does not consider the possibility of texture options such as `-bm 1.000000` appearing before/after the path.\n\nIn this context a quote from [the Wikipedia article on the OBJ format](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wavefront_.obj_file#Vendor-specific_alterations) is relevant:\n\n> According to the spec, options are supposed to precede the texture filename.\n> However, at least one vendor generates files with options at the end. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP\n2. Notice the missing normals (the bricks should stick out from the wall).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot_obj_wall_bump_2025-09-09_11-31-47.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22230975/godot_obj_wall_bump_2025-09-09_11-31-47.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110345/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110345/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}